                        "entry_id": "c80a4ca6-0612-37d7-9180-ec2cf13e937c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het niet nakomen van wat men beloofd heeft"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce67c7bd-62e5-4549-ba8d-39ae43eadcca",
                                "sense_id": "38b9b72b-8023-3856-8115-838650de379e",
                                "text": "De Eerste Kamer maakt altijd een eigen afweging. Dat zei PvdA-leider Diederik Samsom dinsdag in reactie op een vraag van journalisten of er woordbreuk is gepleegd in de Senaat. Het is immers gebruikelijk dat regeringsfracties kabinetsplannen steunen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f89af9b5-062e-42bd-b528-7f3a697bb0d7",
                                "sense_id": "38b9b72b-8023-3856-8115-838650de379e",
                                "text": "Die beslissing leidde tot een diplomatieke rel tussen beide landen. India verweet Italië woordbreuk omdat de Italiaanse ambassadeur had beloofd dat de twee terug zouden komen. Het constitutioneel hof in New Delhi verbood ambassadeur Daniele Mancini India te verlaten."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "79403c95-beb8-4375-9f3a-2e5e725da350",
                        "source_entry_id": "c80a4ca6-0612-37d7-9180-ec2cf13e937c",
                        "source_sense_id": "38b9b72b-8023-3856-8115-838650de379e",
                        "target_lang_word": "breach of promise",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "breach of promise",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "93bea91d-0227-3032-90f4-cd92608ccd6c",
                                        "entry_id": "fa26abaf-3a10-3e5b-8a6b-8c78d2b4d87c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see breach, promise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b65b0297-0743-4d62-ae41-cb80feec771f",
                                                "sense_id": "93bea91d-0227-3032-90f4-cd92608ccd6c",
                                                "text": "In all such cases, the wrongful act, is the refusal to pay the money, according to promise; and this breach of promise, is laid in what is called the common breach or conclusion, at the end of the whole declaration."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94c485f9-153c-3a00-ac71-4e0c5a7afe54",
                                        "entry_id": "fa26abaf-3a10-3e5b-8a6b-8c78d2b4d87c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tort in common law arising when a man withdraws an earlier promise to marry a woman; abolished in many jurisdictions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a69dfaa4-88bf-4f6e-b349-533b5fae64dd",
                                                "sense_id": "94c485f9-153c-3a00-ac71-4e0c5a7afe54",
                                                "text": "But suppose an agreement to marry made by a man in Scotland with a minor lady in England, would we decern for damages for breach of promise in such a case?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb34e022-37a2-46e3-b369-8bdf54761ad6",
                                                "sense_id": "94c485f9-153c-3a00-ac71-4e0c5a7afe54",
                                                "text": "A ‘breach of promise’ case being 'played out in the courts' was covered over three consecutive days and given substantial prominence especially on the commercial channels' bulletins (this was the last ‘breach of promise case’ in the state of Victoria, which may account for the sustained coverage)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae600317-383b-452f-9914-c30979651733",
                                                "sense_id": "94c485f9-153c-3a00-ac71-4e0c5a7afe54",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, pointing a finger at young men and punishing them with breach-of-promise lawsuits did little to address the problem of fallen women."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
